<!--
  The EU subdivision authority table (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/subdivision),
  release 20260923-0, as published by the Publications Office: the kinds of division and annex the
  converter names eIds after (PRT, TIS, CPT, SCT, SBS, ANX, APP, PRO), with their labels in the 24 EU
  languages. © European Union, reuse authorised (Commission Decision 2011/833/EU). Taken from the
  Cellar SPARQL endpoint with:

  CONSTRUCT { ?c a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <…/authority/subdivision> ; skos:notation ?code ;
                 skos:prefLabel ?pref ; skos:altLabel ?alt }
  WHERE { VALUES ?c { <…/subdivision/PRT> … <…/subdivision/APP> }
          BIND(STRAFTER(STR(?c), "/subdivision/") AS ?code)
          ?c skos:prefLabel ?pref . OPTIONAL { ?c skos:altLabel ?alt } }
-->
